        story: 'Use this when the whole card is a single call-to-action — for example, navigating to a detail page or selecting an option.\\n\\nAction buttons are not shown when the card itself is interactive. The entire surface — image, heading, and copy — responds to hover and click.\\n\\nAvoid placing unrelated links or interactive elements inside an interactive card.'
